<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>$365,000 Czech ATP tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Galo Blanco (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat Thomas Carbonell (Spain) 1-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Richard Fromberg (Australia) beat Marcos Aurelio Gorriz</p>
<p>(Spain) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>4-Cedric Pioline (France) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
